# Local evaluation runs can contain large native result bundles, release
# archives, host paths, and repeated intermediate review candidates. Keep the
# curated synthetic manifests and screenshots, but do not make raw runner
# output part of repository history.
docs/evaluations/**/*.log
docs/evaluations/**/*.zip
docs/evaluations/**/*.tar.gz
docs/evaluations/2026-08-31-macos-relationship-workbench/reviews/rc*/
